# LSP Wire Protocol

File: lsp/docs/protocol.oot

JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdin/stdout. Framing is `wire/lsp_stdio.oo`.
Dispatch is `server/lsp_server_dispatch.oo`. 17 methods.

## 1. Framing

```
Content-Length: <bytes>\r\n
\r\n
<json-body>
```

Caps: 4 MB per frame, 100 MB per session, 1_000_000 messages.
A body larger than 4 MB is dropped (notifications) or `-32602` (requests).
Text is not truncated.

## 2. Errors

- `-32600` - initialize called twice
- `-32601` - unknown method or unknown executeCommand
- `-32602` - not initialized, URI traversal, URI outside root, denied path, oversized text

Denied URI path prefixes: `/proc`, `/dev`, `/etc`, `/root`.
`file:///home` is not denied. Workspace roots under `/home` are valid.

## 3. Lifecycle

`initialize` requires `rootUri`. Response includes capabilities and `serverInfo`.
`initialized` is a notification with no reply.
`shutdown` replies `null`. `exit` ends the stdio loop.

## 4. Document methods

- `didOpen` / `didChange`: merge pub fn/struct/enum/type under CompilerReadCap, then publish WEIGHT and PINS
- `didClose`: publish `diagnostics: []`
- `completion`: `{isIncomplete:false, items:[...]}` from the index
- `hover`: markdown contents or `null`
- `definition`: Location or `null`. Cap tokens need `--oodar-root`.
- `documentSymbol`: `kind=12` for `pub fn`
- `formatting`: one full-file TextEdit (tabs to 4 spaces, trailing ws stripped)
- `codeAction`: quickfix for `E_EM_PINS` only (delete the pin line)
- `diagnostic`: `{items:[...]}` pull mode
- `documentLink`: `&Cap` to oodar grant files when the cap table is loaded
- `inlayHint`: `let` / `let mut` literal type hints only. Bare assignment is silent.

## 5. Workspace

`workspace/executeCommand`: `ooda.lsp.version`, `ooda.lsp.indexSize`, `ooda.lsp.echo`, `ooda.lsp.tokenCount`.

## 6. Trust

`textDocument` is required. Params-level `uri`/`text` is ignored.
A URI with a `..` segment is refused. A URI that is not under `rootUri` is refused.
